### Create
POST http://localhost:8080/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Learn Redis Cache","description":"RedisTemplate + MySQL","completed":false}

### GET: first call -> DB/cache miss; next call -> Redis/cache hit
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### TTL
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1/cache-ttl

### Search + pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/todos?keyword=redis&completed=false&page=0&size=10

### Update: DB + cache update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Learn RedisTemplate deeply","description":"Cache aside + invalidation","completed":true}

### Delete: DB + cache eviction
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/1

### Clear all Todo cache
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/todos/cache